{
  "uid": "hcs-pipeline",
  "title": "HCS pipeline",
  "description": "Os seis painéis do §14.2. Definidos em ficheiro e não clicados, para viverem num diff.",
  "tags": [
    "hcs"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "1 — Saúde do run",
      "description": "Progresso, débito e taxa de erro. A primeira pergunta de quem chega: está a andar, e a que ritmo.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(celery_task_duration_seconds_count{status=\"DONE\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "unidades/s concluídas",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(celery_task_duration_seconds_count{status=~\"FAILED|INCOMPLETE\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "unidades/s falhadas",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(celery_task_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 por unidade (s)",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "2 — Memória vs. tamanho de input  ⟨painel âncora⟩",
      "description": "A prova visual do Objetivo B-WSI. A linha da memória fica plana enquanto a dos bytes por unidade sobe. Separado por `kind`, porque um campo HCS e uma lâmina diferem em quatro ordens de grandeza e é essa a questão.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(worker_memory_rss_bytes) by (phase)",
          "legendFormat": "RSS {{phase}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(unit_bytes_processed_bucket[10m])) by (le, kind))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 bytes/unidade {{kind}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "3 — Memória vs. concorrência",
      "description": "O Objetivo B-HCS. RSS agregado contra número de workers vivos: a soma sobe linearmente e o pico por processo não.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(worker_memory_rss_bytes{phase='steady'})",
          "legendFormat": "RSS agregado",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(worker_memory_rss_bytes{phase='steady'})",
          "legendFormat": "pico por processo",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "count(count(worker_memory_rss_bytes) by (worker_id))",
          "legendFormat": "workers vivos",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "4 — Fila e backpressure",
      "description": "Profundidade contra as marcas do §10, e as rejeições 429. A fila nunca deve passar da marca alta: se passar, o dispatcher por blocos não está a segurar.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "celery_queue_depth",
          "legendFormat": "profundidade {{queue}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(ingestion_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "429/s",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(celery_task_retries_total[5m])) by (error_class)",
          "legendFormat": "retries/s {{error_class}}",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(celery_dlq_total)",
          "legendFormat": "DLQ acumulado",
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "5 — Eficiência do batching",
      "description": "Fase 7. Distribuição do tamanho de batch de inferência: concentrada em 1 significa que o batching não serve de nada, e é melhor saber isso do que supor. Vazio até o Ray Serve existir.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(inference_batch_size_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "mediana do batch",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(inference_wait_time_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 de espera (s)",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "6 — Qualidade científica",
      "description": "Z′ por placa, rejeições de QC e células detetadas. Um Z′ a cair ao longo de semanas é um problema de ensaio, não de software — e só se vê se estiver a ser registado desde o início. O Z′ chega na Fase 6.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "plate_z_prime",
          "legendFormat": "Z′ {{plate}} / {{readout}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(qc_rejected_total[15m])) by (reason)",
          "legendFormat": "QC rejeitado/s {{reason}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cells_detected_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "células/s",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
